{
  "info": {
    "name": "Gestión de Monitores Académicos",
    "description": "Colección de los 7 endpoints del contrato (docs/api-contract.md §8) con pruebas automáticas.\n\nLas cuatro capas exponen las mismas rutas (contrato A4): cambia la variable `baseUrl` para probar cada una.\n\n| Capa | baseUrl |\n|---|---|\n| nginx (entrada pública) | http://localhost:8080/api |\n| Java | http://localhost:8081 |\n| PHP | http://localhost:8082 |\n| Python | http://localhost:8083 |\n\nEjecuta las carpetas en orden (Collection Runner o `newman run`). La carpeta CRUD crea, consulta, actualiza y borra el monitor de prueba `DEV-001` (prefijo DEV-, contrato §12) y lo deja eliminado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "codigo",
      "value": "DEV-001",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Salud y materias",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Content-Type JSON UTF-8\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.match(/application\\/json;\\s*charset=utf-8/i));",
                  "pm.test(\"status ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"service válido\", () => pm.expect([\"java-controller\", \"php-service\", \"python-service\"]).to.include(pm.response.json().service));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Salud del servicio que atiende (no consulta la capa siguiente, T3). `service` vale java-controller, php-service o python-service."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /materias",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Content-Type JSON UTF-8\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.match(/application\\/json;\\s*charset=utf-8/i));",
                  "const materias = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Arreglo plano (J3)\", () => pm.expect(materias).to.be.an(\"array\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Incluye SW3 con id 1\", () => pm.expect(materias).to.deep.include({ id: 1, codigo: \"SW3\", nombre: \"Ingeniería de Software III\" }));",
                  "pm.test(\"Ordenada por nombre\", () => { const n = materias.map(m => m.nombre); pm.expect(n).to.eql([...n].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b, \"es\"))); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/materias",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "materias"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista de materias ordenada por nombre (J7). Solo lectura."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. CRUD de monitores (en orden)",
      "item": [
